--- index.html
+++ index.html
@@ -15,6 +15,73 @@
 <div class="view" id="view-upgrades"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">Night phase // fortify before dawn</div><h2>Shelter upgrades</h2><p>Permanent improvements. Costs rise with each tier; build choices shape your survival odds.</p></div><span class="tag" id="upgradePhase">NIGHT REQUIRED</span></div><div class="upgrade-grid" id="upgradeGrid"></div><div class="notice">Night actions do not consume turns. End the night when ready; one ration is consumed and the next day begins.</div></div>
 <div class="view" id="view-manual"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">Afterlight // design specification</div><h2>Field manual</h2><p>Survival is arithmetic. Know what each action costs before you commit.</p></div><span class="tag">RULESET 1.0</span></div><div class="field-grid"><article class="field-card"><h3>01 / Turn-based combat</h3><p>Strict 1-to-1 action exchange: one player action, then one living zombie response. No clocks, animation, or simultaneous actions. Each encounter begins at a location-defined distance. Choose Shoot, Melee, Use item, or Escape.</p><div class="formula">Shot hit % = clamp(82 − 12×max(0, distance−2) − 15×contact, 20, 92)</div><p>Ranged attacks have a 2 m sweet spot. Beyond it, each extra meter lowers accuracy by 12 points. At contact (0 m) accuracy is additionally reduced by 15. A miss consumes one round; a hit deals weapon damage. Zombie advances 1 m if out of reach, otherwise attacks. Every third round it may screech: no damage, but next escape chance −10 points.</p><div class="formula">Escape % = clamp(65 + 7×distance − 8×threat − 10×wound − 10×screech, 15, 90)</div><p>Threat = route tier modifier (0–3); wound = 1 below 50% health; screech = 1 while rattled. Successful escape secures the field bag and ends the outing. Defeat recovers half the bag, rounded down.</p></article><article class="field-card"><h3>02 / Weapons & ammunition tree</h3><ul><li><b>Pipe:</b> 7 damage, 0 ammo, durability 12 hits. Craft: 2 scrap + 1 wood.</li><li><b>Revolver:</b> 12 damage, durability 20 shots. Bench I: 4 scrap + 2 parts; one .38 round per shot.</li><li><b>Carbine:</b> 18 damage, durability 24 shots. Bench II: 6 scrap + 4 parts; one 5.56 round per shot.</li><li><b>.38 ammunition:</b> craft 4 rounds: 1 scrap + 1 parts. <b>5.56:</b> craft 3 rounds: 2 scrap + 1 parts.</li><li>Weapon wear accrues only on successful hits. At 0 durability it is unusable; repair costs 2 scrap + 1 parts for up to 10 durability.</li></ul><p>Bench I unlocks revolver and .38. Bench II unlocks carbine and 5.56. The starter Pipe is reliable but makes closing distance dangerous.</p></article><article class="field-card"><h3>03 / Route loot progression</h3><ul><li><b>Playground · Tier 1 / threat 0:</b> 1–3 loot rolls; food 45%, cloth 30%, scrap 25%. 0–1 infected; 3–5 m.</li><li><b>Park · Tier 2 / threat 1:</b> 2–4 rolls; food 35%, wood 30%, cloth 20%, parts 15%. 1–2 infected; 2–5 m.</li><li><b>Gym · Tier 3 / threat 2:</b> 3–5 rolls; scrap 35%, parts 30%, food 20%, cloth 15%. 1–2 infected; 1–4 m.</li><li><b>City Square · Tier 4 / threat 3:</b> 4–6 rolls; parts 35%, scrap 30%, food 20%, ammo 15%. 2–3 infected; 0–4 m.</li></ul><p>Higher-tier routes provide more rolls and scarce materials, but increase enemy count and damage, and reduce escape odds. Field bag starts at 8 units. Each material occupies one unit.</p></article><article class="field-card"><h3>04 / Shelter & daily loop</h3><ul><li><b>Food plot I → II → III:</b> +1 ration per night per tier; costs 3 wood + 2 scrap, then 5 wood + 3 parts, then 7 wood + 5 parts. Night consumes 1 ration. At zero food, lose 8 health.</li><li><b>Weapon bench I → II:</b> unlocks revolver/.38, then carbine/5.56. Costs 4 scrap + 2 parts; tier II costs 6 scrap + 4 parts.</li><li><b>Pack I → II:</b> capacity +4 each tier. Costs 3 cloth + 2 scrap, then 5 cloth + 4 parts.</li><li><b>Night:</b> all fabrication and upgrades happen at home; rest restores 4 health. End Night consumes food and starts next dawn.</li></ul><p>Daily sequence: Dawn → one daytime expedition → automatic secure return → night chest/crafting/upgrades → End Night (food upkeep, health check, next dawn). Shelter tasks are un-timed.</p><div class="formula">Night net food = stored rations − 1 + plot output</div></article></div></div></section><div class="footer-note">FIELD TERMINAL 04.11 // NO LIVE ACTION · TURN-BASED · LOCAL SAVE</div></main></div>
 <nav class="mobile-nav"><button class="active" data-view="home"><span>⌂</span><span>Home</span></button><button data-view="map"><span>⌖</span><span>Map</span></button><button data-view="storage"><span>▤</span><span>Chest</span></button><button data-view="upgrades"><span>⚙</span><span>Build</span></button></nav><div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal"><div class="modal"><div class="section-kicker">FIELD REPORT</div><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><p id="modalBody"></p><div class="modal-actions" id="modalActions"></div></div></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
 <script>
-<!--APPEND-->
+const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
+const STORE='afterlight-shelter-v1';
+const ITEMS={food:['Rations','🥫'],scrap:['Scrap','▧'],wood:['Timber','⌁'],parts:['Parts','⚙'],cloth:['Cloth','▤'],bandage:['Bandage','＋'],ammo38:['.38 rounds','•'],ammo556:['5.56 rounds','•']};
+const WEAPONS={pipe:{name:'Pipe',damage:7,max:12,ammo:null},revolver:{name:'Revolver',damage:12,max:20,ammo:'ammo38'},carbine:{name:'Carbine',damage:18,max:24,ammo:'ammo556'}};
+const ROUTES=[
+ {id:'playground',name:'Playground',icon:'⌁',day:1,tier:0,distance:3,desc:'Small, familiar streets. Low risk, modest salvage.',pool:['wood','cloth','scrap'],drop:'A quiet block of homes and a fenced play lot.'},
+ {id:'park',name:'Park',icon:'♧',day:2,tier:1,distance:4,desc:'More ground to search; more infected in the green.',pool:['wood','food','cloth','parts'],drop:'The paths are overgrown. Search the maintenance sheds.'},
+ {id:'gym',name:'Gym',icon:'▣',day:3,tier:2,distance:2,desc:'Dense salvage and close quarters. Bring a weapon.',pool:['scrap','parts','cloth','food'],drop:'A smashed fitness center with a locked equipment cage.'},
+ {id:'square',name:'City Square',icon:'⌖',day:4,tier:3,distance:5,desc:'The richest cache in the district—and the worst odds.',pool:['parts','scrap','food','ammo38','ammo556'],drop:'The central plaza is exposed. Every storefront is picked over.'}
+];
+const RECIPES=[
+ {id:'bandage',name:'Field bandage',desc:'Cloth into a quick dressing. Restores 25 health in combat.',cost:{cloth:2},out:{bandage:1}},
+ {id:'pipe',name:'Reinforced pipe',desc:'A dependable close-range weapon · 7 damage · 12 durability.',cost:{scrap:2,wood:1},weapon:'pipe'},
+ {id:'revolver',name:'Revolver',desc:'Bench I · 12 damage · uses .38 rounds.',cost:{scrap:4,parts:2},weapon:'revolver',bench:1},
+ {id:'ammo38',name:'.38 ammunition ×4',desc:'Craft four rounds for a revolver.',cost:{scrap:1,parts:1},out:{ammo38:4},bench:1},
+ {id:'carbine',name:'Carbine',desc:'Bench II · 18 damage · uses 5.56 rounds.',cost:{scrap:6,parts:4},weapon:'carbine',bench:2},
+ {id:'ammo556',name:'5.56 ammunition ×3',desc:'Craft three rounds for a carbine.',cost:{scrap:2,parts:1},out:{ammo556:3},bench:2},
+ {id:'repair',name:'Repair equipped weapon',desc:'Restore up to 10 durability to your equipped weapon.',cost:{scrap:2,parts:1},repair:true}
+];
+const UPGRADES=[
+ {id:'bench',name:'Workbench',icon:'⚒',max:2,desc:'Unlock weapon fabrication. Tier I enables the revolver and .38; tier II enables the carbine and 5.56.',base:{scrap:3,wood:2},step:{scrap:3,parts:2}},
+ {id:'garden',name:'Rooftop garden',icon:'♧',max:3,desc:'Produce +1 ration each night per tier, after tonight’s ration is consumed.',base:{wood:3,scrap:1},step:{wood:2,scrap:2}},
+ {id:'barricade',name:'Door barricade',icon:'▤',max:3,desc:'Reduce incoming infected damage by 2 per tier, minimum 1.',base:{wood:3,scrap:2},step:{wood:2,scrap:2}},
+ {id:'pack',name:'Field pack',icon:'▣',max:3,desc:'Add 4 carry slots per tier. Applies to every item in the field bag.',base:{cloth:2,wood:2},step:{cloth:2,wood:2}},
+ {id:'bunk',name:'Reinforced bunk',icon:'⌂',max:3,desc:'Increase maximum health by 10 per tier and restore 8 health at each dawn.',base:{wood:3,cloth:2},step:{wood:2,cloth:2}}
+];
+const fresh=()=>({day:1,phase:'day',health:100,maxHealth:100,inv:{food:4,scrap:3,wood:2,parts:1,cloth:2,bandage:1,ammo38:0,ammo556:0},weapons:{pipe:12,revolver:0,carbine:0},weapon:'pipe',upgrades:{bench:0,garden:0,barricade:0,pack:0,bunk:0},expedition:null,routeDone:false,log:['Shelter protocol initialized. One route is available today.']});
+function load(){try{const v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORE));if(!v||typeof v!=='object')return fresh();const d=fresh();return {...d,...v,inv:{...d.inv,...v.inv},weapons:{...d.weapons,...v.weapons},upgrades:{...d.upgrades,...v.upgrades},log:Array.isArray(v.log)?v.log.slice(-12):d.log};}catch{return fresh();}}
+let s=load(),toastTimer;
+function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORE,JSON.stringify(s));}catch{}}
+function toast(m){const el=$('toast');el.textContent=m;el.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),2200);}
+function showView(name){document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(e=>e.classList.toggle('active',e.id==='view-'+name));document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(e=>e.classList.toggle('active',e.dataset.view===name));window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}
+function itemName(k){return ITEMS[k]?.[0]||k;}
+function costText(cost){return Object.entries(cost).map(([k,n])=>`${n} ${itemName(k)}`).join(' · ');}
+function canPay(cost){return Object.entries(cost).every(([k,n])=>(s.inv[k]||0)>=n);}
+function pay(cost){Object.entries(cost).forEach(([k,n])=>s.inv[k]-=n);}
+function bagCount(bag=s.expedition?.bag||{}){return Object.values(bag).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);}
+function bagCap(){return 8+4*s.upgrades.pack;}
+function stashBag(bag,ratio=1){Object.entries(bag||{}).forEach(([k,n])=>s.inv[k]=(s.inv[k]||0)+Math.floor(n*ratio));}
+function addBag(k,n){const e=s.expedition;if(!e)return;const room=Math.max(0,bagCap()-bagCount());const got=Math.min(n,room);if(got)e.bag[k]=(e.bag[k]||0)+got;return got;}
+function showModal(title,body,actions){$('modalTitle').textContent=title;$('modalBody').textContent=body;const box=$('modalActions');box.innerHTML='';actions.forEach(a=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='btn '+(a.secondary?'secondary':'');b.textContent=a.label;b.dataset.action=a.action;box.append(b);});$('modal').classList.add('open');}
+function closeModal(){$('modal').classList.remove('open');}
+function renderResources(){const entries=['food','scrap','wood','parts','cloth','bandage','ammo38','ammo556'];$('resourceList').innerHTML=entries.map(k=>`<div class="resource-row"><span>${ITEMS[k][1]} ${itemName(k)}</span><strong>${s.inv[k]||0}</strong></div>`).join('');$('storageItems').innerHTML=entries.map(k=>`<div class="item-row"><span>${ITEMS[k][1]} ${itemName(k)}<small>${k.startsWith('ammo')?'Ammunition':k==='food'?'One ration is consumed each night':'Shelter supply'}</small></span><span class="item-count">× ${s.inv[k]||0}</span></div>`).join('')+Object.keys(WEAPONS).map(k=>`<div class="item-row"><span>${WEAPONS[k].name}<small>${s.weapon===k?'Equipped':'Weapon'} · durability ${s.weapons[k]||0}/${WEAPONS[k].max}</small></span><span class="item-count">${s.weapons[k]>0?`<button class="btn secondary" data-equip="${k}">${s.weapon===k?'Ready':'Equip'}</button>`:'—'}</span></div>`).join('');}
+function renderRoutes(){const grid=$('locationGrid');grid.innerHTML=ROUTES.map(r=>{const locked=s.day<r.day,done=s.routeDone||s.phase!=='day';return `<article class="loc-card ${locked?'locked':''}"><div class="loc-top"><span class="loc-icon">${r.icon}</span><span class="difficulty">${'◆'.repeat(r.tier+1)} / THREAT ${r.tier+1}</span></div><h3>${r.name}</h3><p>${locked?`Unlocks on day ${String(r.day).padStart(2,'0')}.`:r.desc}</p><div class="loc-foot"><span>${r.distance} m · ${r.tier===0?'light':r.tier<3?'moderate':'severe'} threat</span><button class="btn ${locked||done?'secondary':''}" data-route="${r.id}" ${locked||done?'disabled':''}>${locked?'Locked':done?'Route closed':'Enter route →'}</button></div></article>`;}).join('');}
+function renderRecipes(){const canNight=s.phase==='night';$('recipeGrid').innerHTML=RECIPES.map(r=>{const locked=(r.bench||0)>s.upgrades.bench,owns=r.weapon&&s.weapons[r.weapon]>0&&r.weapon!=='pipe';let allowed=canNight&&!locked&&canPay(r.cost)&&!owns;if(r.repair)allowed=canNight&&canPay(r.cost)&&(s.weapons[s.weapon]||0)<WEAPONS[s.weapon].max;return `<article class="recipe"><div class="recipe-head"><h4>${r.name}</h4><span class="recipe-cost">${locked?`Workbench ${r.bench} required`:costText(r.cost)}</span></div><p>${r.desc}${owns?' Already fabricated.':''}</p><button class="btn ${allowed?'':'secondary'}" data-craft="${r.id}" ${allowed?'':'disabled'}>${r.repair?'Repair':owns?'Owned':locked?'Locked':!canNight?'Night only':'Fabricate'}</button></article>`;}).join('');}
+function upgradeCost(u){return Object.fromEntries(Object.keys(u.base).map(k=>[k,u.base[k]+(u.step[k]||0)*s.upgrades[u.id]]));}
+function renderUpgrades(){ $('upgradeGrid').innerHTML=UPGRADES.map(u=>{const lv=s.upgrades[u.id],cost=upgradeCost(u),max=lv>=u.max,ok=s.phase==='night'&&!max&&canPay(cost);return `<article class="upgrade-card"><div class="upgrade-icon">${u.icon}</div><div class="upgrade-level">${max?'MAX LEVEL':`TIER ${lv} / ${u.max}`}</div><h3>${u.name}</h3><p>${u.desc}</p><span class="recipe-cost">${max?'Fully upgraded':costText(cost)}</span><button class="btn ${ok?'':'secondary'}" data-upgrade="${u.id}" ${ok?'':'disabled'}>${max?'Complete':s.phase==='night'?'Install tier '+(lv+1):'Night required'}</button></article>`;}).join('');}
+function updateCombat(){const e=s.expedition;if(!e)return;const z=e.zombie;const weapon=WEAPONS[s.weapon];$('combatLocation').textContent=`Expedition // ${e.routeName}`;$('zombieName').textContent=z.name;$('zombieStatus').textContent=z.hp<z.maxHp?'Wounded · closing':'Unsteady · closing';$('distanceReadout').innerHTML=`${e.distance} m<small>${e.distance===0?'CONTACT':e.distance<=1?'MELEE RANGE':'CONTACT RANGE'}</small>`;$('zombieHpText').textContent=`${z.hp} / ${z.maxHp}`;$('zombieHpMeter').style.width=`${Math.max(0,z.hp/z.maxHp*100)}%`;$('rangeDot').style.left=`${Math.max(5,Math.min(95,90-e.distance*14))}%`;$('roundLabel').textContent=`ROUND ${String(e.round).padStart(2,'0')}`;$('combatTurn').textContent='YOUR TURN';$('combatFeed').innerHTML=e.feed.slice(-5).map(x=>`<div>${x}</div>`).join('');const hasRanged=weapon.ammo&&s.weapons[s.weapon]>0&&s.inv[weapon.ammo]>0;$('shootBtn').disabled=!hasRanged;$('shootDesc').textContent=hasRanged?`${weapon.name} · ${s.inv[weapon.ammo]} rounds · ${weapon.damage} dmg`:'No loaded ranged weapon';$('meleeBtn').disabled=!s.weapons.pipe||e.distance>1;$('meleeDesc').textContent=e.distance>1?'Too far · close to 1 m':`Pipe · ${WEAPONS.pipe.damage} damage`;$('itemBtn').disabled=!(s.inv.bandage>0&&s.health<s.maxHealth);$('itemDesc').textContent=s.inv.bandage?`Bandage · restore 25 (${s.inv.bandage})`:'No bandages';const chance=escapeChance();$('escapeDesc').textContent=`Success chance ${chance}%`;$('combatTip').textContent=e.rattled?'The infected rattled you. Escape chance is reduced by 10 points this turn.':'At distance 0–1 m, the infected can strike after your action.';$('bagReadout').textContent=`FIELD BAG · ${bagCount()} / ${bagCap()} capacity`;$('abandonBtn').disabled=false;}
+function escapeChance(){const e=s.expedition;if(!e)return 0;return Math.max(15,Math.min(90,Math.round(65+7*e.distance-8*e.threat-(s.health<s.maxHealth/2?10:0)-(e.rattled?10:0))));}
+function render(){const night=s.phase==='night';$('dayLabel').textContent=`DAY ${String(s.day).padStart(2,'0')}`;$('phaseLabel').textContent=night?'NIGHT PHASE':s.phase==='combat'?'EXPEDITION':'DAY PHASE';$('healthText').textContent=`${s.health} / ${s.maxHealth}`;$('healthMeter').querySelector('span').style.width=`${Math.max(0,s.health/s.maxHealth*100)}%`;$('foodStatus').textContent=s.inv.food||0;$('bagStatus').textContent=s.expedition?`${bagCount()} / ${bagCap()}`:`0 / ${bagCap()}`;$('weaponStatus').textContent=WEAPONS[s.weapon].name;$('homePhase').textContent=night?'Night phase':s.phase==='combat'?'Expedition active':'Day phase';$('homeTitle').innerHTML=night?'The door is barred.<br>Make it count.':'One more day.<br>One more chance.';$('homeSub').textContent=night?'The streets are quiet for now. Fabricate supplies, improve the shelter, then prepare for dawn.':'The streets still have supplies. The shelter still needs them. Choose a route, keep your head, and be back before dark.';$('doorHeading').textContent=night?'Night watch.':s.phase==='combat'?'You are beyond the door.':'The street is waiting.';$('doorText').textContent=night?'Use the workbench and shelter systems before ending the night. One ration is consumed at dawn.':s.phase==='combat'?'An encounter is underway. Every choice costs exactly one response from the infected.':'One expedition per day; what you carry home is yours to keep.';$('heroAction').textContent=night?'Prepare for dawn →':s.phase==='combat'?'Return to encounter →':'Open the door →';$('heroAction').dataset.action=night?'dawn':s.phase==='combat'?'combat':'map';$('doorAction').textContent=night?'Review upgrades ↗':s.phase==='combat'?'Continue encounter ↗':'Review map ↗';$('doorAction').dataset.action=night?'upgrades':s.phase==='combat'?'combat':'map';$('mapStatus').textContent=s.phase==='day'&&!s.routeDone?'ROUTE OPEN':s.phase==='combat'?'EXPEDITION ACTIVE':'ROUTE CLOSED';$('storagePhase').textContent=night?'NIGHT FABRICATION':'NIGHT REQUIRED'